"Welcome to Alien Invasion \n\n\n" +
            "\t\tThis is (currently) a text-based game\n" +
            "\twhere you will use loose text commands to navigate yourself through the story that plays out on the screen.\n\n" +
            "\tFor example, if you want to move up on the screen, you'd select the text input bar in the middle and type:\n\n" +
            "\t\t'Move up', or 'go north' and then press the [ENTER] key.\n\n" +
            "\tYou can be fairly loose with your commands as we saw above, but in general you'll want to use an action word (verb)\n" +
            "\tfollowed by a thing (noun).\n" +
            "\tSome actions you might want to try:\n\n" +
            "\t\t\b1go\tmove\tget\ttalk\tlook\tdrop\tquit\b0\t...\n\n" +
            "\tSome of these you can use on their own, some need the noun as well.\n\n" +
            "Play around and have fun and be sure to like and comment below!" ;